Z||000008||Haze_Performance||08-11-2001||02:16 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by AL:<BR><B>what kind of rims are those? and what size tires are they? i would like my indy to look like that.can you send them to me also? please.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>They are 16" Centerlines & I believe they were made for the Indy exclusively. There not our lug pattern. We have 5 x 100mm, the REAL Indy used Firebird rotors.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif">  <P><P>------------------<BR><A HREF="http://www.ws6fiero.com" TARGET=_blank>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/indyclick.gif">  <BR></A><BR><FONT SIZE="1"><FONT COLOR="red"><B>Click above to visit my website.</B></FONT></FONT>||||reg||9
